    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World of Lines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You happen to find yourself in a dungeon. The world around you is made entirely out of lines. Equipped with nothing, but a power to bend those lines, you are tasked with transforming the environment in order to complete various trials and eventually escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583570/extras/1c17daf48cfd9ac390066d0364cb8fa4.poster.avif?t=1748012851\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583570/extras/1c17daf48cfd9ac390066d0364cb8fa4.webm?t=1748012851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583570/extras/1c17daf48cfd9ac390066d0364cb8fa4.mp4?t=1748012851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn and exploit different block properties</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe how the world behaves by exploring over 50 mind-bending levels of various difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583570/extras/6094c4216d6fa2e54211ceaf297f3a30.poster.avif?t=1748012851\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583570/extras/6094c4216d6fa2e54211ceaf297f3a30.webm?t=1748012851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583570/extras/6094c4216d6fa2e54211ceaf297f3a30.mp4?t=1748012851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own levels and share them with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583570/extras/bc206f40f36156a926684e931e5697da.poster.avif?t=1748012851\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583570/extras/bc206f40f36156a926684e931e5697da.webm?t=1748012851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583570/extras/bc206f40f36156a926684e931e5697da.mp4?t=1748012851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
